      "content": "This intense sense of being a \"burden\" often arises when grief becomes so loud that it convinces us we have no right to remain loved. Please know that your existence is fundamentally different from an accident or a theft; you caught a life that was already meant for you. While your pain is real and valid, trying to erase yourself to fix their sorrow would only deepen it for everyone involved, including yourself.",
